# The LiteLLM or chart-render venv, if someone points BENCH_VENV_DIR or
# RENDER_VENV_DIR here instead of the default location outside the repo.
# Never commit one: it is large and its third-party files are not ours to
# carry. The default for both is outside the tree (see run.sh, README.md).
.venv/
render-venv/
bench-venv/
# Local driver output, if run outside the default out/bench (which the root
# .gitignore already excludes).
*.jsonl
results/
